Vendored from https://github.com/bbbbbr/tilepalquant at the commit in UPSTREAM_COMMIT.
Only the files needed by scdcpk are included. These files remain under the MIT
license in LICENSE.

Changed for scdcpk:
  quant.h    no PNG include; quantizeImage returns its image through an out
             parameter; declares quantizeImageWithPalettes.
  quant.cpp  the same API changes; quantizeImageWithPalettes (remap with fixed
             palettes); per-tile work split across threads via par_for
             (scdcpk src/par.h); dithered color choices cached per palette;
             fixed-size candidate array in getClosestColorDither.

All other files are unmodified.
